Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:50:19 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/34] Finder: Golden Gate sidebar

Favorites (Recents, home folders) and Locations (devices, network, trash)
sections from KFilePlacesModel, accent-tinted symbolic icons (gray when the
window is inactive), rounded selection, mounting on demand and a small
context menu. Replaces the Places panel in the dock.

